// LeetCode #70: Climbing Stairs
// You can climb 1 or 2 steps at a time.
// How many distinct ways to reach the top of n stairs?
// This is exactly the Fibonacci sequence: ways(n) = ways(n-1) + ways(n-2).

// Use a stream generator: stairs[n] gives the answer for n stairs.
// stairs[1] = 1, stairs[2] = 2, stairs[n] = stairs[n-1] + stairs[n-2]
stairs = [1, 2, ... (a, b) -> a + b]

// Tests
print(stairs[0]) // 1  (n=1)
print(stairs[1]) // 2  (n=2)
print(stairs[2]) // 3  (n=3)
print(stairs[3]) // 5  (n=4)
print(stairs[4]) // 8  (n=5)
print(stairs[9]) // 89 (n=10)
